{
  "type": "comfy",
  "name": "Pro 3 Image",
  "displayPriority": 250,
  "tags": ["MiniMax H3", "16MP", "high-vram"],
  "description": "Using MiniMax H3 Image this preset produces highly detailed images of up to 16 megapixels (4K) with strong prompt adherence in only 6 steps.",
  "extendedDescription": "Use Pro 3 with long, detailed, and descriptive prompts that describe specifics of what's in the foreground, background, lighting, aesthetic, and style of image. MiniMax H3 Image is trained for high resolutions and works best between 4 and 16 megapixels; it also renders text and full sentences accurately.",
  "backend": "comfyui",
  "category": "create-images",
  "mediaType": "image",
  "toolCategory": "create-images",
  "toolInstructions": "Generate a detailed, descriptive prompt that specifies subjects, composition, style, lighting, colors, mood, and any literal text to render in the image. MiniMax H3 Image produces very high resolution (up to 16 megapixels) photorealistic and illustrated images and renders text accurately. When the user requests text in the image, quote the exact text in the prompt. Even if the user requests something simple, expand it to include composition, lighting, materials and style. Generation is slow and resource-intensive, so prefer it when the user wants maximum detail or a large print-quality image.",
